Mioktans are centipede-things fifteen feet long, and they fight from a distance, flinging whatever is at hand. One can grow a club of bone out of an arm.

Two of them guarded the drug works at 414 Anchor Street in [[Geography/Calaria/Hallia/Deosil|Deosil]] for [[People/Sbrtlby Jotes|Sbrtlby Jotes]], alongside three [[Bestiary/Pusk|pusks]]. Both were killed in the fight there.
